{"seq":42,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a2648"},"reason":"Notes now record that the black-paint decree is usually dated 1562 (Senate under Doge Gerolamo Priuli) while some accounts (e.g. Rick Steves) put the law in the 17th century; the answer is unaffected.","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://www.ricksteves.com/watch-read-listen/read/articles/the-gondolas-of-venice"},{"url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20100303172720/http://www.comune.venezia.it/flex/cm/pages/ServeBLOB.php/L/IT/IDPagina/3397"}],"changes":[{"field":"notesEn","diff":[["=",25],["+"," The black-paint decree is usually dated to 1562 (the Senate, under Doge Gerolamo Priuli); some accounts place the law in the 17th century – the answer, black, is the same either way."]]},{"field":"notesDe","diff":[["=",17],["+"," Die Vorschrift des schwarzen Anstrichs wird meist auf 1562 datiert (Senat unter Doge Gerolamo Priuli); manche Darstellungen setzen das Gesetz ins 17. Jahrhundert – die Antwort, Schwarz, bleibt dieselbe."]]},{"field":"notesRu","diff":[["=",17],["+"," Указ о чёрной окраске обычно датируют 1562 годом (сенат при доже Джироламо Приули); некоторые источники относят закон к XVII веку – ответ, чёрный цвет, от этого не меняется."]]}],"hash":"004573316cb8","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"9a472e8bd00b87d48e338d3ff504c7380a9675759e82ad952edcf42cb8ce8c08"},
